(6700562, 1002284, 41129, '<td valign="top">great shot,, BUT.. your title isn''t a palindrome.. each word on their own is a palindrome, but together they arent.. "REDDER EYE" reads as "EYE REDDER" backwards.. not the same thing.. a palindrome phrase has to read the same backwards, just as a palindrome word does.. just a case of misunderstanding how palindromes work. shame, great photo,, still gonna give you a 7 for the photo, but that would have been a 9 had the palindrome been done correctly to meet the challenge.</td>', 'great shot,, BUT.. your title isn''t a palindrome.. each word on their own is a palindrome, but together they arent.. "REDDER EYE" reads as "EYE REDDER" backwards.. not the same thing.. a palindrome phrase has to read the same backwards, just as a palindrome word does.. just a case of misunderstanding how palindromes work. shame, great photo,, still gonna give you a 7 for the photo, but that would have been a 9 had the palindrome been done correctly to meet the challenge.', '2012-03-05 11:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
