(6701345, 1002385, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  There are different ways to interpret this shot.  At first glance, I thought it didn''t meet palindrome.... simply because this is a desert, rather than a dessert.  However, maybe there is a story... maybe there is a guy, walking all alone, hungry.  Perhaps it isn''t a steak, or a burger, or a salad that he wants to eat... maybe he wants something sweet. <br/>Or maybe, the word DESSERTS was confused with DESERT?  Who knows.  :)<br/>A very lovely photo, and it would have been a terrific entry for the All Along challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  There are different ways to interpret this shot.  At first glance, I thought it didn''t meet palindrome.... simply because this is a desert, rather than a dessert.  However, maybe there is a story... maybe there is a guy, walking all alone, hungry.  Perhaps it isn''t a steak, or a burger, or a salad that he wants to eat... maybe he wants something sweet. Or maybe, the word DESSERTS was confused with DESERT?  Who knows.  :)A very lovely photo, and it would have been a terrific entry for the All Along challenge!', '2012-03-06 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
