(6701390, 1001670, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great palindrome.  Nice sepia.  The expression could have been a little more sensual to depict sensuousness, but it''s a nice depiction.</td>', 'Great palindrome.  Nice sepia.  The expression could have been a little more sensual to depict sensuousness, but it''s a nice depiction.', '2012-03-06 10:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701391, 1002298, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great processing.  Love the composure.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great processing.  Love the composure.  Nice shot.', '2012-03-06 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701393, 1002490, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the action of the dog... beautiful shot.  The only thing is that the face is a little blurred, a little sharper here and the picture would have really popped.</td>', 'Love the action of the dog... beautiful shot.  The only thing is that the face is a little blurred, a little sharper here and the picture would have really popped.', '2012-03-06 10:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701395, 1001394, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Nice detail and love the look on the dog''s face.</td>', 'Cute shot.  Nice detail and love the look on the dog''s face.', '2012-03-06 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701396, 1002471, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It implies that the car is actually racing, being that it is a race car.  Great color contrasts.  Love the blur.</td>', 'I really like this.  It implies that the car is actually racing, being that it is a race car.  Great color contrasts.  Love the blur.', '2012-03-06 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701397, 1002370, 134859, '<td valign="top">Exactly... he sees "eh".  What is it he sees?  Does it even matter what it is?  Abstract art at it''s finest!  LOVE THIS!  10</td>', 'Exactly... he sees "eh".  What is it he sees?  Does it even matter what it is?  Abstract art at it''s finest!  LOVE THIS!  10', '2012-03-06 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701398, 1002389, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  The color is a little dull, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Nice focus.  The color is a little dull, but that''s just my opinion.', '2012-03-06 10:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701399, 1002204, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the angle.  Great conveyance of the palindrome.  Love the colors, the lines, the reflections... it''s a great shot</td>', 'Love the angle.  Great conveyance of the palindrome.  Love the colors, the lines, the reflections... it''s a great shot', '2012-03-06 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701400, 1002317, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this... something different.  Rather than a word palindrome, it''s a picture, reflecting itself.  The main difference I noticed were the shoelaces.  The other thing is the lighting.  Makes them look different, rather than the same.  But, it''s a great composure and idea.</td>', 'I like this... something different.  Rather than a word palindrome, it''s a picture, reflecting itself.  The main difference I noticed were the shoelaces.  The other thing is the lighting.  Makes them look different, rather than the same.  But, it''s a great composure and idea.', '2012-03-06 10:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701401, 1001221, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice close up, but the reflection of the lighting is a little bright on the apple.</td>', 'A nice close up, but the reflection of the lighting is a little bright on the apple.', '2012-03-06 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701402, 1002495, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the black cat in the back... hard to see, which is a great way to express the palindrome.  Not sure what the pear has to do with the picture, but it''s an interesting add.</td>', 'Love the black cat in the back... hard to see, which is a great way to express the palindrome.  Not sure what the pear has to do with the picture, but it''s an interesting add.', '2012-03-06 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701403, 1002240, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the way you''ve done this photo.  Very different, nothing average or traditional about it.  You can tell it''s an eye, but fluorescent.  Interesting.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Love the way you''ve done this photo.  Very different, nothing average or traditional about it.  You can tell it''s an eye, but fluorescent.  Interesting.  Nice shot.', '2012-03-06 10:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701404, 1002308, 134859, '<td valign="top">Looks like the person in the foreground is snapping a shot with a cell phone (somewhat of a peeping tom).  I like the noise in the photo... it adds mystery.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like the person in the foreground is snapping a shot with a cell phone (somewhat of a peeping tom).  I like the noise in the photo... it adds mystery.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-06 11:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701405, 1002409, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very dark, eerie, almost evil.  It''s something you''d expect to be in a scary movie.  I like the way this is shot.</td>', 'Very dark, eerie, almost evil.  It''s something you''d expect to be in a scary movie.  I like the way this is shot.', '2012-03-06 11:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701407, 1002504, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The fact that the moon is in crisp detail, when the foreground is blurred.  The black and white conversion.  It''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'Love this.  The fact that the moon is in crisp detail, when the foreground is blurred.  The black and white conversion.  It''s a lovely shot.', '2012-03-06 11:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701408, 1001716, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Nice palindrome.  It just doesn''t stand out to me, though.  It''s a little plain, perhaps a more blurred background would have improved the shot?  But then again, this is just my opinion.  :)  Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Nice palindrome.  It just doesn''t stand out to me, though.  It''s a little plain, perhaps a more blurred background would have improved the shot?  But then again, this is just my opinion.  :)  Still, a nice shot.', '2012-03-06 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701410, 1002496, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It''s different, it''s dark, it''s almost lonely.  Would have done well in the All Alone challenge.  Great vignette, lovely black and white.  Nice detail.  I do think the foreground is a little too focused (where the sticks at the bottom are)... but other than that, very nicely done.</td>', 'I like this.  It''s different, it''s dark, it''s almost lonely.  Would have done well in the All Alone challenge.  Great vignette, lovely black and white.  Nice detail.  I do think the foreground is a little too focused (where the sticks at the bottom are)... but other than that, very nicely done.', '2012-03-06 11:03:29.000000', NULL, 1);
