(6706911, 1002349, 94815, '<td valign="top">Does Not Meet Challenge Can Not Meet Demand? I guess it''s better than Dna Sand or Dust Sud or Wet Sand Na Stew... A deliciously ethereal even transendental image. I keep wanting to look again to see if the wave moves when I glance away. 8</td>', 'Does Not Meet Challenge Can Not Meet Demand? I guess it''s better than Dna Sand or Dust Sud or Wet Sand Na Stew... A deliciously ethereal even transendental image. I keep wanting to look again to see if the wave moves when I glance away. 8', '2012-03-11 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
