(6706924, 1002481, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good find for the title and very nice processing of the textures especially given the low resolution of the posted result. Beautifully rendered bw tones make this so sweet to view. My personal taste doesn''t understand the bars. Is this supposed to be a tv image, which is the only place we ever see these things - a necessity because of the fixed aspect ratio of the screen. In an art gallery, it sould probably be displayed something like this with a plain white frame: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1004053" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/94815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1004053.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/94815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1004053.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/94815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1004053.jpg"/></a> <br/>I love the shot but the bars are a distraction. A 9 for that reason only - should have been a 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-12 00:32:19.</i></td>', 'Good find for the title and very nice processing of the textures especially given the low resolution of the posted result. Beautifully rendered bw tones make this so sweet to view. My personal taste doesn''t understand the bars. Is this supposed to be a tv image, which is the only place we ever see these things - a necessity because of the fixed aspect ratio of the screen. In an art gallery, it sould probably be displayed something like this with a plain white frame:  I love the shot but the bars are a distraction. A 9 for that reason only - should have been a 10.', '2012-03-11 13:15:14.000000', '2012-03-12 00:32:19.000000', 1),
