(6707137, 1001935, 94265, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re going with this one, a bit of a creative stretch I think but the symmetrical rocks are interesting, the image is quite nice overall.</td>', 'I see where you''re going with this one, a bit of a creative stretch I think but the symmetrical rocks are interesting, the image is quite nice overall.', '2012-03-11 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707138, 1001341, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting mannequins, I like that their ''make-up'' is nice but they''re still battered and chipped in contrast. I like the composition. Not sure why the added title in brackets was needed though?</td>', 'Interesting mannequins, I like that their ''make-up'' is nice but they''re still battered and chipped in contrast. I like the composition. Not sure why the added title in brackets was needed though?', '2012-03-11 20:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
