(6707140, 1001270, 94265, '<td valign="top">Eek! I hope this didn''t spread too far. The title suggests toasted owls, I hope not, lol. Good exposure on this, although I feel a slightly different crop would have been better so as not to chop off the top of the flames.</td>', 'Eek! I hope this didn''t spread too far. The title suggests toasted owls, I hope not, lol. Good exposure on this, although I feel a slightly different crop would have been better so as not to chop off the top of the flames.', '2012-03-11 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
