(6708226, 1002411, 117474, '<td valign="top">Man. Wrote a huge comment but lost it cause I pressed back on my.phone. <br/> <br/>For me, the fencing in the background was a bit of a problem in this image. Sky was great and I would have loved to have had that throughout. Might have gotten that with a tighter crop, but you might have hurt the wonderful bonnet then, so best not! <br/>The tape suggested more to do with auditory abstinence rather than basil''ian abstinence to me. <br/>Also, for some reason I didn''t like the colouring around the eyes...<br/> <br/>Lots of positives too of course. Processing, crop, hat, light are top notch. Measly voters!</td>', 'Man. Wrote a huge comment but lost it cause I pressed back on my.phone.  For me, the fencing in the background was a bit of a problem in this image. Sky was great and I would have loved to have had that throughout. Might have gotten that with a tighter crop, but you might have hurt the wonderful bonnet then, so best not! The tape suggested more to do with auditory abstinence rather than basil''ian abstinence to me. Also, for some reason I didn''t like the colouring around the eyes... Lots of positives too of course. Processing, crop, hat, light are top notch. Measly voters!', '2012-03-12 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 0),
