(6711966, 1002496, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>This is a very well done shot, I gave you a 7 in voting.  I like the loneliness implied here and it''s eerie that the date is one day before my birthday, November 27th.<br/> <br/>There is a great range of tones here; there is also a few cluttery items behind the cross that are a bit distracting.  Don''t know if you could have moved them or not, but they do draw the eye away a bit.  The vignetting at the corners might not suit all tastes either.  The comp plays very safe with its centredness - shooting more from the ground up might have made for a more impactful image.  Don''t be afraid to hunker down and shoot up at a subject, especially one like this.<br/> <br/>Overall a pleasing image, sorry that it didn''t do better.  But as has been suggested, it could have easily been entered in All Alone, too.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me.<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! This is a very well done shot, I gave you a 7 in voting.  I like the loneliness implied here and it''s eerie that the date is one day before my birthday, November 27th. There is a great range of tones here; there is also a few cluttery items behind the cross that are a bit distracting.  Don''t know if you could have moved them or not, but they do draw the eye away a bit.  The vignetting at the corners might not suit all tastes either.  The comp plays very safe with its centredness - shooting more from the ground up might have made for a more impactful image.  Don''t be afraid to hunker down and shoot up at a subject, especially one like this. Overall a pleasing image, sorry that it didn''t do better.  But as has been suggested, it could have easily been entered in All Alone, too. Feel free to PM me. Susan', '2012-03-16 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
