(6998888, 1002480, 60173, '<td valign="top">I didn''t notice the shorter gal''s hand until <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> mentioned it. To me it looks like it''s a carton of milk. Maybe I just want it to be a carton of milk to go along with Melethia''s comment about "smoking not stunting everyone''s growth." Milk is, after all, supposed to make you big and strong.<br/> <br/>Honestly, after appreciating the general composition, due to leading lines, my eyes were directed to the larger woman''s breasts. Man, that woman''s in dire need of a good bra. The shorter gal unfortunately is forced to stare at those. I deduct that they keep their friendship professional and are not very good friends, otherwise the shorter gal should feel obligated to say something about her terrible/lack of bra. Or maybe! Maybe if the taller woman wears a proper bra she won''t be able to make eye contact with the shorter gal. Perhaps she forgoes breast support for the sake of communication. Maybe they really are great friends after all.</td>', 'I didn''t notice the shorter gal''s hand until  Melethia mentioned it. To me it looks like it''s a carton of milk. Maybe I just want it to be a carton of milk to go along with Melethia''s comment about "smoking not stunting everyone''s growth." Milk is, after all, supposed to make you big and strong. Honestly, after appreciating the general composition, due to leading lines, my eyes were directed to the larger woman''s breasts. Man, that woman''s in dire need of a good bra. The shorter gal unfortunately is forced to stare at those. I deduct that they keep their friendship professional and are not very good friends, otherwise the shorter gal should feel obligated to say something about her terrible/lack of bra. Or maybe! Maybe if the taller woman wears a proper bra she won''t be able to make eye contact with the shorter gal. Perhaps she forgoes breast support for the sake of communication. Maybe they really are great friends after all.', '2013-03-13 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
